# cross-lib-decision — Lib B (the SHARED decision library).
library "Shared".

// A reusable sub-decision that a decision in ANOTHER library (Root) delegates to
// via `use decision "Shared"."Sub Triage"`. Lib B is a decision-bearing library
// with NO concept-level `code is` (its condition is `coded from`, a RecordSource
// concept), so it stays a SINGLE `Shared` CQL library (NOT auto-split) and emits
// its own Decision + Recommendation + ActivityDefinition PlanDefinitions.

terminology "Severe Crohns VS":
- valueset is `http://example.org/vs/severe-crohns`.

concept "Severe Crohns":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- coded from "Severe Crohns VS".

activity "Shared Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Denied.`.

decision "Sub Triage":
- when "Severe Crohns" then recommend activity "Shared Deny".
